@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Identity & Access" {
  class User <<AggregateRoot>>
  class Role <<AggregateRoot>>
}

package "Backoffice Configuration" {
  class Manufacturer <<AggregateRoot>>
  class EngineModel <<AggregateRoot>>
  class AircraftModel <<AggregateRoot>>
  class AirControlArea <<AggregateRoot>>
  class Airport <<AggregateRoot>>
}

package "Customer Management" {
  class AirTransportCompany <<AggregateRoot>>
  class CustomerCollaborator <<AggregateRoot>>
  class Pilot <<AggregateRoot>>
  class Aircraft <<AggregateRoot>>
  class FlightRoute <<AggregateRoot>>
}

package "Flight Planning" {
  class Flight <<AggregateRoot>>
  class FlightPlan <<AggregateRoot>>
}

package "Weather Service" {
  class WeatherSource <<AggregateRoot>>
  class WeatherImportBatch <<AggregateRoot>>
  class WeatherData <<AggregateRoot>>
}

package "Simulation Integration" {
  class Simulation <<AggregateRoot>>
  class SimulationReport <<AggregateRoot>>
}

User --> Role : assigned roles

CustomerCollaborator --> User : system identity
Pilot --> User : system identity

CustomerCollaborator --> AirTransportCompany : works for
Pilot --> AirTransportCompany : works for
Aircraft --> AirTransportCompany : belongs to
FlightRoute --> AirTransportCompany : owned by

Airport --> AirControlArea : belongs to

EngineModel --> Manufacturer : made by
AircraftModel --> Manufacturer : made by
AircraftModel --> EngineModel : certified engine models

Aircraft --> AircraftModel : model
Aircraft --> EngineModel : selected engine model

FlightRoute --> Airport : origin
FlightRoute --> Airport : destination

Flight --> FlightRoute : instantiates route
FlightPlan --> Flight : plan for
FlightPlan --> Aircraft : assigned aircraft
FlightPlan --> Pilot : assigned pilot

WeatherImportBatch --> WeatherSource : imported from
WeatherData --> AirControlArea : registered for

Simulation --> AirControlArea : simulated area
Simulation --> FlightPlan : input plans
Simulation --> WeatherData : weather input
SimulationReport --> Simulation : result of

@enduml